## Conclusion

**LFAS is strategically conservative.** The core (loop, pillars, guarantee) has been immutable since v2.1. Every subsequent version added **verification, automation, and proof layers** while preserving the foundation.

This design ensures:
- ✅ Protocol stability (core never changes)
- ✅ Continuous improvement (layers added without risk)
- ✅ Backward compatibility (older versions can coexist with newer)
- ✅ Future extensibility (new detectors/layers plug in without breaking core)
